:: OC Millers Trouble in Paradise 1 [nobr]

As you enter the school ready to begin another day, you suddenly spot <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> at the end of the hall being given some papers by <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Headmaster Alistair</span>. He inspects them for a moment before noticing you and waving you over. <br>

/* AVATAR DISPLAY */
	<<set $AD.Name to "Isaiah">>
	<<set $AD.Arms to "Normal">>
	<<set $AD.Eyes to "Normal">>
	<<set $AD.Cry to 0>>
	<<set $AD.Blush to 0>>
	<<set $AD.Mouth to "Happy">>
